
  <sn><md>### Selectively Merging Files Between Git Branches

When Should You Use This Method?

Use this workflow when:

* You want to copy only specific files or folders from another branch.
* You don't want new directories from the source branch.
* You don't want unrelated commits merged.
* You want complete control over every imported change.
</md></sn>
